   "text": "the reason why starting with one is so powerful is when you go on Watsi, you see a particular patient, you can empathize with their story. No longer is it this global health and millions of people who need help with their health. It's here's this one child, here's this one mother, here's this one father, and when you read it, you say, well, that could be me, that could be my father, that could be my mother, that could be my child",
